{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>הקרב</b> Four times in the Masorah: (here); וזאת תורת המנחה הקרב אותה בני אהרן; וגם את אחיך וגו' הקרב; הקרב את מטה לוי. הקרב אליך — and afterward the meal-offering, for he is not fit for priesthood until he is trained with the garments. And a hint to him that he should bring to him the Levites, as it is written: נתונים נתונים המה לי." "<b>ואתה הקרב אליך את אהרן אחיך</b> Three times אהרן in the verse — a hint to the three priests who would remain: Aaron, Eleazar, and Ithamar. Three times לכהנו לי in the parashah — corresponding to the First Temple, the Second Temple, and the future."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {0 "The four-occurrence masorah juxtaposes הקרב across four verses; the second citation is from Numbers 28:31, the third from Numbers 18:2, the fourth from Numbers 18:6. The 'meal-offering' phrase links to the second citation's context.", 1 "The three occurrences of לכהנו לי are in Exodus 28:1, 28:3, and 28:4."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:34.401844080Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}